# Decisions

Use short decision records for durable choices that affect design, data handling, naming, or scope, but do not need full ADR-style alternatives analysis.

Pending approvals belong in [../open/OPEN_DECISIONS.md](../open/OPEN_DECISIONS.md). Once approved and implemented, promote durable decisions into a numbered record here.

Prefer numbered files such as `0001-short-title.md`.

